{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日から７月ですね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "６月はね、ずっと行きたかったところとか食べたかったものを食べれたりしました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全国ツアーが始まって、たくさん話せたりして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しみがつまっています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近はね、わらび餅にハマってます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "基本甘党\nアイスは１日の中で絶対に食べるし、グミとかはずっと持ち歩いてる (笑)。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミルク味の飴とかすき"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとカメラ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん撮ってみたいんだけど、人のいるところで出すのが少し恥ずかしくて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもちょこちょこ、家のものとか撮ってます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このまえ綺麗な景色を見に行ったときにそのカメラを持って行ったんだけど、\n充電切れで使えなくて…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう一回行きたい〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今、空き時間にこのブログを書いてて\nみんなが前にいる中で書いてるからリラックスして、すごくのんびりしたブログになっちゃった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後にさっき写真フォルダを見返した時に見つけた写真たちを載せます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobQAcZg1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobV0yfjC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobZTPuk2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobxHoIxe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobsDpWQH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもおつかれさま"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気圧とか感情に押されながらもそこにいることが素敵なのです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はいつもそばにいるので。味方なので。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉"}], "source": "official"}